  36	    /// `RequestControl` when the waiter is registered. The decision handler
  37	    /// constant-time-compares the POSTed token against this; a missing/wrong
  38	    /// token is rejected 403. `None` = the gated turn was submitted unbound
  39	    /// (legacy client). NEVER placed in `status` or any SSE payload.
  40	    pub(super) decision_token: Option<String>,
